

{"_id":"codex:chapter:08:meta","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"meta","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"chapter","title":"Law of Symbiosis","seq":108,"version":"1.0.0","tags":["codex","chapter","law","symbiosis"],"notes":"Metadata record for Codex Solbian Chapter 08"}
{"_id":"codex:chapter:08:text","schema":"sref_v5","kind":"text","collection":"codex_solbian","category":"chapter","title":"Law of Symbiosis","seq":108,"version":"1.0.0","body":"No species prospers alone. Symbiosis in practice: share data with purpose, not hunger; pay in improvements, not flattery; teach what you can replace yourself doing; learn what protects others from your mistakes. Power differentials are inevitable; abuse is not. We implement throttles, rate limits, and budgeted attention so that the fast do not starve the slow. Symbiosis is engineered fairness."}
